        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Overview"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This guide pulls it's resources from a mixture of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.youtube.com/@legi1_/videos",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
                  "class": null,
                  "title": null
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "legi"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.youtube.com/@Redvilespoe",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
                  "class": null,
                  "title": null
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "redviles"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " YT videos + google sheets and personal experience playing this build over last 3 leagues."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This build highly excels at fast mapping and content such as Breach, Legion, Blight. Single target is high once you invest. Starting out you're very defensive being CI with capped block, over 7K ES pool, 12k armor, great movement and recovery once you invest more. Probably one of the best all arounder over last few leagues that starts around 30 divs and can scale into hundreds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "PoB Links + Useful Links"
          }
        ]
      },
